<article>
  <p>If your repository looks like a hedgehog made of feature branches you forgot about, you are not alone. This guide shows how to inspect, remove, and clean up git branches without accidentally tossing work into the void. It stays accurate while being a little sarcastic about our collective tendency to never delete anything.</p>

